{"slug":"Universal-Script-break-log-23768","_id":"6750b95b094bbc195b7064ed","title":"break log","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":"/images/sb/6515314-1733343579795.png","placeId":0},"features":"its my first hook experience.\n\nhere's how it works:\nwhen player executes print or warn or error or printidentity\nand those function have argument then\ninstead of logging it to console the hook will defunction them and create a new folder in coregui called 'HookCommunication' creates a label there with a name of argument.\n\nyou can add functions simply by adding a function to functions table.\n\nalso it is a simple way to create lags by spamming a while loop script with print and task.wait() inside.","tags":["break log","log","console","break","punishment"],"script":"local functions = {print,printidentity,warn,error}\nfor i, func in functions do\n    local hook = hookfunction(func, function(v)\n        if not game.CoreGui:FindFirstChild('HookCommunication') then\n            local uhhfd = Instance.new('Folder', game.CoreGui)\n            uhhfd.Name = 'HookCommunication'\n        end\n        local d = Instance.new('TextLabel',game.CoreGui:FindFirstChild('HookCommunication'))\n        d.Text = v\n        d.Name = v\n    end)\nend","owner":{"_id":"662c002c61d29c1291f500cb","username":"VateQ","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/662c002c61d29c1291f500cb-1754571111816.png","status":"offline","id":"662c002c61d29c1291f500cb","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10}},"verified":false,"keyLink":"","views":5675,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2024-12-04T20:19:39.871Z","dislikeCount":0,"likeCount":9,"image":"/images/sb/6515314-1733343579795.png","executes":125,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e6b360710ec3c5356e","editBy":{"_id":"662c002c61d29c1291f500cb","username":"Vate